  "title": "Egg Halwa",
  "description": "This halwa is a rich, Indian dessert of eggs and milk flavored with cardamom. Keep stirring or else it will burn! You can add vanilla if you feel it tastes too eggy. It&#39;s a little heavy, so even a small portion is enough to satisfy your sweet tooth.",
